OneTimeUseIdPolicy::consume
├── it should burn the id for the caller, and emit IdConsumed
├── given the id was already burned
│   └── when consume is called again
│       └── it should revert with AlreadyConsumed (exactly one consume per settlement)
├── given a stranger calls with another account's id
│   └── it should burn the stranger's own record and leave the account's untouched
├── given a different id is burned
│   └── it should leave this id untouched
└── it should not nominate any settlement (the settling check requires consumeFor's proof)
